{
  "file_id": "3548",
  "text_count": 106,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������W-where are we...?",
      "_offset": 3852,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "There's humans everywhere...",
      "_offset": 3879,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Did we...did we do it? Did we make\nit back to our world?",
      "_offset": 3908,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "What about Etemon? Where are the\nothers?",
      "_offset": 3965,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "No doubt about it! We're near my\nplace! We're back in Japan!",
      "_offset": 4006,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "This is your world, Tai?",
      "_offset": 4067,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Must be because of that distortion\nwe got sucked into! That must be \nwhy you devolved to Koromon!",
      "_offset": 4095,
      "_length": 97,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "This is great, Tai!",
      "_offset": 4193,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "We did it, we did it!",
      "_offset": 4216,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "This is my house, Koromon! I\nwonder if Mom and Dad are okay...",
      "_offset": 4238,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Your place, huh...",
      "_offset": 4301,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "(How long has it been since I went\nto the other world?)",
      "_offset": 4320,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "(Maybe someone I've never met will\nopen the door.)",
      "_offset": 4376,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Tai, are you okay?",
      "_offset": 4427,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Yeah...ah, excuse me...",
      "_offset": 4449,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Kari...",
      "_offset": 4473,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "You're back, Tai.",
      "_offset": 4483,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Y-yeah....",
      "_offset": 4504,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "You brought Koromon with you?",
      "_offset": 4515,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 4545,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "You...You're not surprised to see\nhim?",
      "_offset": 4550,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Why should I be surprised? I mean,\nit's just Koromon, right?",
      "_offset": 4589,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Where are Mom and Dad?",
      "_offset": 4650,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "They left this morning to visit\nGrandma, since she's sick and all,\ndidn't they?",
      "_offset": 4673,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Y-yeah, you're right.",
      "_offset": 4753,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Tai, where'd you really go?",
      "_offset": 4775,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 4806,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Did you go to Koromon's world?",
      "_offset": 4811,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "So you didn't go to camp with the\nother kids after all...",
      "_offset": 4842,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Oh, right. Maybe the others came\nback too.",
      "_offset": 4900,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "No one else is back. Are they\nstill on the other side?",
      "_offset": 4943,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "This is the afternoon news for\nAugust 1. First, the daily report.",
      "_offset": 4998,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "In terms of the abnormal weather,\nthere has still been no rain in\nSoutheast Asia...",
      "_offset": 5064,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Tai! Look!",
      "_offset": 5148,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Ah, that's Meramon!",
      "_offset": 5162,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Record-breaking rains in the\nMiddle East have caused flooding,\nNorth America is covered in snow.",
      "_offset": 5182,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Seadramon and Frigimon! This\nisn't just abnormal weather!",
      "_offset": 5279,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "The distortion from the Digital\nWorld is affecting my world, too!",
      "_offset": 5340,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Now you can see them, Tai? You\ntoo?",
      "_offset": 5406,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "You can see them?",
      "_offset": 5445,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "I've been able to see them for a\nlong time, but whenever I said\nanything, nobody believed me.",
      "_offset": 5463,
      "_length": 93,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Huh? Tai, that's...",
      "_offset": 5557,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Ah!",
      "_offset": 5580,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "...chi, Tai...",
      "_offset": 5584,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "K-Izzy!",
      "_offset": 5602,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Ta...Tai? Where are...now...?",
      "_offset": 5615,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "I'm at home! I came back to our\nworld! I'm with Koromon right now!",
      "_offset": 5648,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "I see...so...as for here...",
      "_offset": 5715,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Hey, Izzy! I can't hear you!",
      "_offset": 5743,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "...n't come back...please...",
      "_offset": 5777,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Izzy! Koushiroooou!",
      "_offset": 5806,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "What's going on over there, and\nwhat's going on over here...?",
      "_offset": 5831,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Tai...",
      "_offset": 5893,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Hey, Koromon. Is it okay for us to\njust stay here?",
      "_offset": 5903,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "But, Tai...",
      "_offset": 5954,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Yeah. I mean, we don't even know\nhow to get back to the other side.",
      "_offset": 5969,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Hey, Koromon.",
      "_offset": 6037,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "What?",
      "_offset": 6051,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Tai doesn't have to go back,\nright? You can stay here now,\nright?",
      "_offset": 6057,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Both of you can stay here from now\non...",
      "_offset": 6126,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "I mean, Koromon, if you stay at\nour place, you won't need to\nfight.",
      "_offset": 6167,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "You can eat our food, you can eat\nsweets anytime you want.",
      "_offset": 6235,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Tai...",
      "_offset": 6294,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "It's summer vacation! We're on\nsummer vacation right now! We\nstill haven't gone to the beach...",
      "_offset": 6304,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "We have to go see the fireworks,\ntoo! And I haven't done my\nhomework...",
      "_offset": 6400,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "I haven't done my homework...",
      "_offset": 6472,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Tai, what about the Digivice?",
      "_offset": 6502,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "This thing dragged me over there.\nWho cares about it being a holy\ndevice, and all that!",
      "_offset": 6535,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "That's...that's Tyrannomon! Aaaah!\nNo!!",
      "_offset": 6623,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "I'm going, too!",
      "_offset": 6663,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Wait!",
      "_offset": 6679,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Kari, you stay home!",
      "_offset": 6685,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Ah...",
      "_offset": 6708,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Huh? It disappeared!",
      "_offset": 6714,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Huh?! Drimogemon!",
      "_offset": 6735,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "I-it disappeared too.",
      "_offset": 6753,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Tai, I'm going back to the\nothers.",
      "_offset": 6775,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 6813,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Digimon shouldn't be in this\nworld.",
      "_offset": 6818,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "I'm a Digimon, so I can't stay\nhere...",
      "_offset": 6854,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Don't say things like that,\nKoromon! Don't say you're\nleaving...",
      "_offset": 6893,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Taiiiiiiiii!",
      "_offset": 6958,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Kari! I *told* you not to come!",
      "_offset": 6974,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "But...",
      "_offset": 7008,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Tai! Look over there!",
      "_offset": 7015,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Huh? O-Ogremon!",
      "_offset": 7040,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Tai! Get out of here, fast!",
      "_offset": 7056,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Don't go in by yourself! We've\nalways fought together, right?",
      "_offset": 7087,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "_offset": 7149,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Koromon!",
      "_offset": 7157,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "You did it, Agumon!",
      "_offset": 7166,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Tai...Kari...bye-bye.",
      "_offset": 7186,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Wait, Agumon! I'm coming too!",
      "_offset": 7213,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Kari, I'll be sure to come back.",
      "_offset": 7243,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "I've got no choice. I have to go\nwith him...",
      "_offset": 7278,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Get well soon.",
      "_offset": 7323,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Tai...",
      "_offset": 7338,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "So we're back.",
      "_offset": 7348,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "_offset": 7363,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Was this really the right thing to\ndo?",
      "_offset": 7371,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "We'll be sure to return, once\nwe've done what we have to.",
      "_offset": 7410,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Let's go home now.",
      "_offset": 7468,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Um, is Sora there?",
      "_offset": 7487,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "I see...",
      "_offset": 7510,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Is Matt there?",
      "_offset": 7519,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Ah.",
      "_offset": 7540,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}